{"re_salt_wind":{"id":"re_salt_wind","regions":["sallow"],"weight":3,"text":"A wind comes off the pans with salt in it, and for an hour the world is a white hiss and the track is a guess. You walk bent, with your sleeve over your mouth, and come out of it with your eyes raw and the sun somewhere else.","effects":[{"time":60},{"learn":"seen_salt_wind"}]},"re_kite":{"id":"re_kite","regions":["sallow"],"hours":{"from":10,"to":16},"weight":2,"once":true,"text":"Something crosses the sun with no bird in it: long wings, no beat, a shadow that slides over the salt and over you and does not hurry. It looks at you. You are fairly sure of that. Then it is a line, and then nothing.","effects":[{"learn":"seen_kite"},{"lead":"l_kite_seen"},{"xp":20}]},"re_dust_devil":{"id":"re_dust_devil","regions":["sallow"],"hours":{"from":11,"to":17},"weight":2,"text":"A dust devil walks the pan a hundred yards off, tall as a tower, taking its time. Grit in your teeth for a mile after.","effects":[{"time":15}]},"re_old_camp":{"id":"re_old_camp","regions":["sallow"],"weight":2,"once":true,"text":"A ring of stones by the track, and in it the ash of a fire nobody has lit for years, and a tin cup with a bullet hole through it, set upright on a rock as if someone meant to come back for it.","effects":[{"give":"j_scrap","count":2},{"learn":"seen_old_camp"},{"xp":10}]},"re_escort_axle":{"id":"re_escort_axle","regions":["sallow"],"terrain":["road","track"],"weight":14,"once":true,"map":"wild_track","dialogue":"d_re_axle","if":{"flag":"escort_active","eq":"wheel"},"npcs":[{"def":"npc_w_wheel","spot":"ahead","facing":2}]},"re_escort_shakedown":{"id":"re_escort_shakedown","regions":["sallow"],"terrain":["road","track"],"weight":14,"once":true,"map":"wild_track","dialogue":"d_re_shakedown","if":{"flag":"escort_active","eq":"wheel"},"npcs":[{"def":"npc_w_scout_a","spot":"ahead","facing":3},{"def":"npc_w_scout_b","spot":"ahead2","facing":3},{"def":"npc_w_wheel","spot":"fire","facing":0}]},"re_patrol":{"id"